    {
      "id": "bf268c9648f626e3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 1340,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 650,
      "text": "## 关系索引\n\n**E01** · TSMC → Apple\nA/M/S 系列芯片先进制程代工\n\n**E02** · TSMC → NVIDIA\nAI GPU 先进制程代工与封装\n\n**E03** · SK Hynix → NVIDIA\nHBM4E/HBM4/HBM3E\n\n**E04** · Samsung Electronics → NVIDIA\nHBM4/HBM4E\n\n**E05** · Samsung Electronics → Apple\nDRAM/NAND/OLED 组件\n\n**E06** · NVIDIA → Microsoft\nGPU/AI 加速器与 AI 基础设施生态\n\n**E07** · NVIDIA → Amazon / AWS\nNVIDIA GPU 与 AI 基础设施软件栈\n\n**E08** · Amazon / AWS → 外部:AI 初创企业与云客户\nTrainium3、Bedrock、云端训练服务",
      "color": "#334155"
    },
    {
      "id": "dd52617dfea274aa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 1340,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## 关系索引\n\n**E09** · Meta → 外部:EssilorLuxottica\nMeta Glasses AI 眼镜产品线\n\n**E10** · 外部:ASML/EUV → SK Hynix\n用于 HBM/DRAM 扩产的 EUV 设备",
      "color": "#334155"
    }
